NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the code in scripts/ and the generated analysis
(PATTERNS.md, data/). It does NOT cover the contents of corpus/.

Files under corpus/ were written by the authors of the source repositories and
remain under their original licences. Each corpus entry records its upstream
licence and permalink in meta.json. Files whose upstream repository ships no
redistributable licence are not stored — only their structure is.
